3:13:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9390361905097961,"text_excerpt":"Great spot if you enjoy dancehall type music, just be aware that this is the only type of music they play. The drinks are cheap and VERY strong, so you will certainly get a buzz in there. It is, however, quite smoky inside (even though there's a giant sign behind the bar that says \"no smoking inside\"). There's a food truck outside...I haven't tried but it's a nice touch for some late night food outside of the club."},{"business_id":"Wqo81HAqZqoPY7lpbHhZ3Q","review_id":"Hhl0NGt2-cc871MC6M-Gng","date":"2013-02-23T11:01:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8887249827384949,"text_excerpt":"The best reggae club in town bar none bring in the best talent from across the caribbean. Certified real reggae. Smoking is encouraged."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
